The wire capture proved the gemini-native lanes are clean: thought-flagged
parts go to reasoning_content, never content. The 'analysis leaking into
the chat' report is a client-side rendering mismatch — clients that do not
know reasoning_content either drop the thinking or print it as text, which
is why only thinking models (gemini-3.8-flash-tiered always thinks) show
it and always right before their tool calls.

REASONING_FIELD picks the delta/message field the operator's client
understands: reasoning_content (default, unchanged), reasoning, both, or
none (suppress entirely). Applies to both the stream deltas and the
non-stream message on the gemini-native lanes; Claude-format caveat
documented.
